{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は抹茶ソフトクリームを\nぺろぺろしたよ！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は久々にゆっくり寝れた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいことに最近は\n朝から夜まで1日中\nいろんなことをさせていただいて\n疲れてたみたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しくないときの2倍くらい寝てたのに、\n昼寝もしたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっきり(*゜▽゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は\n乃木坂46の『の』公開収録 ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日休んだから\nいつも以上に\n気合いいれる(=゜ω゜)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山中湖是非是非来てね(*´▽｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下手だと\n中田がよく見えると思います｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトル詳しく！\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田はかわたんが好きすぎて\nかわたんぺろぺろ\nってよく言うのね。\nそしたら\nみさたん、れかたん、まりちゃが\nブログに書いてって言ってきました(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"536の写メ目開けてる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nあけてるよ！\n一応、前見えてるんだよ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばもう\n8月なんだよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n乃木坂と、まなぶ\nの語彙・読解力検定の結果\nもう見ていただけたかたもいますね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがたいです○┓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は\n本も読む方ではないし\n生まれながらの理系だし\n本当に自信無かったから嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/02/5492912/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも精進して参ります｀・ω・´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/02/5492912/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだの個別のくま耳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服にあわせて\nアイライン\n目尻ちょっとハネてみたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日、赤リップだったじゃん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、じゃれてたら\n真夏の服の袖に\nつけてしまったんだ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとごめん(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}